00:08:08,540 --> 00:08:11,110
解释为什么这个快速修复是合理的。
explaining why this quick fix was justified.

169
00:08:12,170 --> 00:08:15,130
不知不觉，定时器就蔓延到处都是，
And before you know it, we had timers spreading everywhere

170
00:08:15,130 --> 00:08:18,410
应用的性能大受影响。
and the, you know, the performance of the app really suffered.

171
00:08:20,530 --> 00:08:23,300
在 Grok Bot 里，我们吸取了教训，
Now, in Grok Bot, we learned our lesson there

172
00:08:23,300 --> 00:08:26,690
决定直接禁掉 99% 的注释，
and we decided to just ban 99 percent of comments

173
00:08:26,690 --> 00:08:28,730
因为注释很容易过时。
because they go stale easily.

174
00:08:29,410 --> 00:08:32,690
反正人类也懒得去读那些烂注释。
You know, humans just really don't bother reading the comment slop anyway.

175
00:08:33,380 --> 00:08:36,590
而且它还给了智能体一个退路，
And again, it gives an agent an escape hatch

176
00:08:36,590 --> 00:08:40,700
让它以“太难”为由不去做正确的事。
to justify not doing the right thing because it's hard.

177
00:08:41,740 --> 00:08:44,660
不过注释最糟糕的一点是，它们无法强制执行。
And the worst part about comments though is that they're not enforceable.

178
00:08:45,300 --> 00:08:47,040
所以看似出于好意的做法，
So what seems well intentioned,

179
00:08:47,040 --> 00:08:50,980
比如“我要告诉下一个智能体别做某事”，
you know, like I'm gonna tell the next agent not to do something

180
00:08:50,980 --> 00:08:53,740
最后都不会变成你真正能信任的东西。
never ends up actually being anything that you can trust.

181
00:08:54,700 --> 00:08:57,020
所以在 Grok Bot 和 Dune 里，
So in Grok Bot and Dune,

182
00:08:57,220 --> 00:08:59,840
在 Dune 里，我们现在有 lint 规则，
and in Dune, we now have lint rules

183
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:03,510
会给出很好、很有用的报错信息，
that give good and very helpful error messages

184
00:09:03,510 --> 00:09:07,150
告诉智能体去修复根本原因、真正的问题，
telling the agent to fix the root cause, the real problem,

185
00:09:07,150 --> 00:09:08,960
而不是绕过去打补丁。
rather than just patch around it.

186
00:09:10,560 --> 00:09:12,170
我们的总原则是，
And so our general principle is that

187
00:09:12,170 --> 00:09:15,720
每次纠正智能体，都要把它变成这样一条确定性检查。
every time we correct our agents, it turns into one of these deterministic checks.

188
00:09:16,080 --> 00:09:20,280
或者我们会想办法从代码层面彻底消除这个问题，
Or we think about how to categorically eliminate that problem in the code

189
00:09:20,280 --> 00:09:23,150
靠更好的 API 设计、更好的架构。
through better API design, through better architecture.

190
00:09:23,910 --> 00:09:25,950
这样做的次数够多，
And if you do this enough times,

191
00:09:25,950 --> 00:09:30,110
你会发现代码审查时要留意的东西越来越少。
you'll find that you have just less things to look out for in code review.

192
00:09:30,710 --> 00:09:32,790
到某个时候你会意识到，
And at some point you'll realize

193
00:09:32,790 --> 00:09:34,130
已经没什么可审的了，
there's, there's nothing left to review

194
00:09:34,130 --> 00:09:38,510
你可以让智能体自己合并大部分 PR。
and you can just let agents merge their, most of their own pull requests.

195
00:09:41,010 --> 00:09:42,450
好，我们继续。
Alright, moving on.

196
00:09:42,650 --> 00:09:47,190
验证也是我们让智能体更自主、
Verification is also a really big part of how we make our agents more autonomous

