00:09:56,800 --> 00:10:00,730
比如视频、截图、图表、形式化验证。
So things like videos, screenshots, diagrams, formal verification.

201
00:10:02,350 --> 00:10:05,710
最基本的例子是运行时验证，
And the most basic example of this is runtime verification,

202
00:10:05,710 --> 00:10:07,840
说白了，
which is just a fancy way of saying,

203
00:10:07,840 --> 00:10:10,640
就是让智能体能自己运行代码，
giving your agent a way to run the code for itself

204
00:10:10,640 --> 00:10:14,070
并使用人类开发者也在用的调试工具。
and use debugging tools that, you know, human developers use as well.

