00:10:21,630 --> 00:10:24,110
它基本上就像一张网站地图，
And that's basically kind of like a site map

209
00:10:24,110 --> 00:10:27,160
列出应用里所有可用的功能，
of all of the features that are available in your application

210
00:10:27,160 --> 00:10:28,490
都是从用户的视角出发。
from the user's point of view.

211
00:10:29,130 --> 00:10:31,200
有了它，智能体就不用去猜。
And so with this, agents don't need to guess.

212
00:10:31,320 --> 00:10:33,630
当你说“左边栏里那个东西”时，
When you say, you know, the thingy in the left sidebar,

213
00:10:33,630 --> 00:10:36,080
它让你们有一套共同的词汇。
it gives you some shared vocabulary.

214
00:10:37,520 --> 00:10:40,600
我们还用了自定义 CLI（命令行工具），
And we also make use of custom CLIs

215
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:41,410
放在这些 Skills 里，
inside these skills

216
00:10:41,410 --> 00:10:44,970
让智能体每次都能复用这个 CLI 和驱动程序，
so that agents can reuse the CLI and the driver every time,

217
00:10:44,970 --> 00:10:48,520
既减少了 token（词元）消耗，也便于测试。
which cuts down on token usage and is also testable.

218
00:10:51,040 --> 00:10:53,840
最近，我们也开始研究形式化验证。
And then recently, we've also started looking at formal verification.

219
00:10:54,640 --> 00:10:55,900
我们现在用 TLA+（形式化规格语言），
