00:11:03,320 --> 00:11:05,960
我们也用 Lean（定理证明器）来证明某些算法。
We use Lean as well for proving certain algorithms.

223
00:11:06,760 --> 00:11:11,330
比如，我们自己写了一个虚拟列表库，
For example, we have our own, we wrote our own custom virtualization library

