00:11:12,780 --> 00:11:15,200
有没有闪烁或抖动的问题。
that we don't have, you know, flickering or jittering problems.

226
00:11:16,320 --> 00:11:18,120
这个方法我们还在试验。
And we're still experimenting with this approach.

227
00:11:18,240 --> 00:11:19,920
总体来看，前景很不错。
