327
00:16:28,240 --> 00:16:31,280
对整个应用和整个构建做模糊测试，
that will fuzz the entire application and the entire build

328
00:16:31,280 --> 00:16:35,120
像真实用户一样运行和使用应用来找 bug。
and it will find bugs by running the app and using it like a real user.

329
00:16:35,720 --> 00:16:39,750
然后它会针对找到的每个 bug 开修复 PR，
And then it's gonna open fix PRs for each of those bugs that it finds

330
00:16:39,750 --> 00:16:42,190
还会自动合并，
and it's gonna auto merge it

331
00:16:42,190 --> 00:16:43,640
虽然听起来很疯狂。
as crazy as that sounds.

332
00:16:44,040 --> 00:16:46,720
这是因为我们的代码库足够好，
And that's because our code base is good enough

333
00:16:46,720 --> 00:16:48,920
PR 默认往往就是好的。
that pull requests tend to just be good by default.

334
00:16:49,160 --> 00:16:50,230
我们合入的大部分产品代码，
And most product code that we land

335
00:16:50,230 --> 00:16:53,440
已经不太需要人工深度审查了。
no longer really requires deep human review.

336
00:16:56,020 --> 00:17:01,120
所以当你有了扎实的基础和良好的有机架构，
So when you have solid foundations and good organic architecture,

337
00:17:01,120 --> 00:17:02,340
你就能把烂代码变成金子，
you can turn slop into gold

338
00:17:02,340 --> 00:17:05,470
既能高质量、高速度地交付，
and you can ship with high quality, high velocity

339
00:17:05,470 --> 00:17:08,780
又不用在质量上妥协。
without compromising on quality.

340
00:17:09,460 --> 00:17:11,570
我叫 Potato，也叫 Lauren。
My name is Potato, also known as Lauren.

341
00:17:11,570 --> 00:17:13,380
再次感谢大家听我的演讲。
Thank you again for listening to my talk.
